{"id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#clm:chow-iii-heat-kernel-characterizes-ricci-flow","title":"clm:chow-iii-heat-kernel-characterizes-ricci-flow","path":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics.md","line":247,"body":"","kind":"other","status":"not_started","tex":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics.tex#clm:chow-iii-heat-kernel-characterizes-ricci-flow","uses":["[[references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#thm:chow-iii-evolving-heat-kernel-expansion]]","[[references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#lem:chow-iii-psi-zero-expansion]]","[[references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#lem:chow-iii-psi-one-expansion]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics.tex","label":"clm:chow-iii-heat-kernel-characterizes-ricci-flow","line":466,"source":"\\begin{claim}[Heat kernel asymptotics characterization of Ricci flow]\n\\label{clm:chow-iii-heat-kernel-characterizes-ricci-flow}\n\\source{chow-et-al-ricci-flow-part-iii:page-0307}\n\\uses{thm:chow-iii-evolving-heat-kernel-expansion, lem:chow-iii-psi-zero-expansion, lem:chow-iii-psi-one-expansion}\n\\dcref{ch24:24.26}\n\\group{Ricci Flow Characterization}\n\n\nIf \\(\\mathcal R_{ij}=R_{ij}\\), so \\(g(\\tau)\\) evolves by backward Ricci flow,\nthen\n\\[\n \\Box\\bar f(x,\\tau)+\\frac{\\bar f(x,\\tau)}{\\tau}\n =O\\bigl(d_{g(0)}(x,y)^2+\\tau\\bigr).\n\\]\nIn particular the left side is \\(o(1)\\) as\n\\(d_{g(0)}(x,y)^2+\\tau\\to0\\).\n\\end{claim}","html":" <p></p>\\begin{claim} \\end{claim}[Heat kernel asymptotics characterization of Ricci flow] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-636c6d3a63686f772d6969692d686561742d6b65726e656c2d636861726163746572697a65732d72696363692d666c6f77\"></span> <span class=\"tex-source\" style=\"display:block\">Source: <span class=\"reference\">chow-et-al-ricci-flow-part-iii:page-0307</span></span> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FChowEtAl%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics%23thm%3Achow-iii-evolving-heat-kernel-expansion\">↗ thm:chow-iii-evolving-heat-kernel-expansion</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FChowEtAl%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics%23lem%3Achow-iii-psi-zero-expansion\">↗ lem:chow-iii-psi-zero-expansion</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FChowEtAl%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics%23lem%3Achow-iii-psi-one-expansion\">↗ lem:chow-iii-psi-one-expansion</a> <span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch24:24.26</span></span>\\group Ricci Flow Characterization <p></p>If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\mathcal R_{ij}=R_{ij}$\">$\\mathcal R_{ij}=R_{ij}$</span>, so <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$g(\\tau )$\">$g(\\tau )$</span> evolves by backward Ricci flow, then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  \\Box \\bar f(x,\\tau )+\\frac{\\bar f(x,\\tau )}{\\tau } =O\\bigl(d_{g(0)}(x,y)^2+\\tau \\bigr).  \\]\">\\[  \\Box \\bar f(x,\\tau )+\\frac{\\bar f(x,\\tau )}{\\tau } =O\\bigl(d_{g(0)}(x,y)^2+\\tau \\bigr).  \\]</span> In particular the left side is <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$o(1)$\">$o(1)$</span> as <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$d_{g(0)}(x,y)^2+\\tau \\to 0$\">$d_{g(0)}(x,y)^2+\\tau \\to 0$</span>. \\end{claim}","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: claim、group"]},"previous":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#lem:chow-iii-psi-one-expansion","next":"references/ChowEtAl/bluepr